	"title"		"ka_soccermod_indoor"
	"description"		"[h1]ka_soccermod_indoor[/h1]
An indoor football hall for CS2 SoccerMod, made for small games of three to four players per team.

[h2]What it is[/h2]
[list]
[*] A boarded court with rounded corners, LED adverts on the boards, acrylic panels and nets up to the ceiling net - the ball never leaves play
[*] Goals set into the end boards
[*] Sharp, close-cut turf in two tones with white lines
[*] A main stand with a glass-fronted lounge, a second stand, standing terraces behind both goals, team shelters with bench and coach - all full of fans
[*] Barrel roof with trusses and a skylight, LED light bars, a video cube over the centre spot, screens and team banners on the end walls
[*] Working radar
[/list]

[h2]Made for SoccerMod[/h2]
Kicking, goals, the moving goal nets and matches come from the CS2 SoccerMod server plugin: [url=https://github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod]github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod[/url]. Servers load the SoccerMod item [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3811382872]ka_soccermod_stadium[/url] next to this map; it carries everything the plugin shows and plays. Without the plugin the map loads, but the ball is only a physics prop.

[h2]Patch notes[/h2]
[b]2026-10-01[/b] First version.
"
	"changenote"		"First version."
}
